            0.085,
            0.733,
            0.145
          ],
          "content": "**Q2. Subtract as indicated: a.** $\\frac { 1 3 } { 4 }$ **from** $\\frac { \\mathbf { 1 0 } } { \\mathbf { 3 } }$ b. $\\frac{18}{5} \\operatorname{from} \\frac{23}{3}$ **c.** $\\frac{29}{7}  from  \\frac{45}{7}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.151,
            0.215,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": "Ans. a. $\\frac { 1 } { 1 2 }$ b. $\\frac { 6 1 } { 1 5 }$ c. $\\frac { 1 6 } { 7 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.269,
            0.414,
            0.286
          ],
          "content": "**Q3. Solve the following problems:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.293,
            0.882,
            0.362
          ],
          "content": "**a. Jaya’s school is** $\\frac { 7 } { 1 0 }$ **km from her home. She takes an auto for** $\\frac { 1 } { 2 }$ **km from her home daily, and then walks the remaining distance to reach her school. How much does she walk daily to reach the school?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.369,
            0.878,
            0.471
          ],
          "content": "**b. Jeevika takes** $\\frac { \\mathbf { 1 0 } } { 3 }$ <strong><sub>minutes</sub></strong> **to take a complete round of the park and her friend Namit takes** $\\frac { 1 3 } { 4 }$ <strong><sub>minutes</sub></strong> **to do the same. Who takes less time and by how much?** Ans. a. $\\frac{1}{5}$ Km"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.479,
            0.617,
            0.511
          ],
          "content": "b. Namit takes less time than Jeevika, by $\\frac { 1 } { 1 2 }$ minutes"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
